{2}│{R}{1}⦿ Generate desktop entry for containers    {R}{2}│{R}
{2}├───────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Usage:{R}                                   {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  otter gde --all                          {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  otter gde my-box                         {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  otter generate-entry debian --delete     {2}│{R}
